        <p class="eyebrow">Roadmap</p>
        <h2 class="section-title roadmap-title">The path from lab to launch</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">
          Firmware and Coordinator come first. Retail hardware does not exist yet — and it should not ship on goodwill alone. Manufacturing, production, and independent audits all need funding before a SeedMask device can leave the lab as a product people are asked to trust with keys.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="road-track" aria-label="Company roadmap">
        <div class="road-track-line" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="road-track-progress"></div>
        </div>

        <article class="road-step is-done">
