          <span class="road-tag">Done</span>
          <time>Jan 2026</time>
          <h3>Firmware</h3>
          <p>Bitcoin &amp; Kaspa, air-gap first</p>
        </article>

        <article class="road-step is-done">
          <div class="road-dot"><span>02</span></div>
          <span class="road-tag">Done</span>
